87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agents_tab_freshness.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-124[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-124/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop refresh-pulse writes from poisoning the bounded [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]artifact-delta path[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]pulse-delta[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pulse-delta: classify project-level .ace_refresh_pulse watcher paths as [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a pure freshness kick instead of an unknown_watcher_path fallback [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](leaving per-agent-directory pulses exact for sase-zr.7.3), and fix [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-zc by routing the two misplaced pulse writers through the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]touch_shell_refresh_pulse helper.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Give the load/capacity indicator a cheap refresh path [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]independent of broad loads[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]capacity-fresh[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capacity-fresh: recompute the runner-capacity snapshot from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in-memory roster on tab entry with a guard so older in-flight loads [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cannot overwrite it, token-track limit-override/holds changes, and fix [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the stale agent-info metrics memo key.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Take the federation attention RPC off the auto-refresh [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]critical path[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]tick-diet[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tick-diet: make per-tick fleet-attention polling cache-backed with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]longer network recompute cadence, run it concurrently with local [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces, and add tick trace counters for it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cut broad Tier 1 load and post-apply warmup cost on large [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]archives[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]broad-load-diet[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]broad-load-diet: profile then cache/coalesce the unwindowed per-load [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project/patch sweeps, the bead-confirmation/monitor/live-hint warmups, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the detail-header rebuilds, and evaluate incremental Tier 1 index [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]revalidation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove Agents-tab UI-thread hitches (unread ack, info-panel [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]countdown)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ui-hitches[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ui-hitches: move the unread-ack notification-store mutation off the UI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]thread with optimistic row updates, and make the 1 s info-panel [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]countdown patch only the countdown segment.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bounded marker polling so in-flight node status converges [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]without broad loads[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]inflight-status[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pulse-delta[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inflight-status: extend the STARTING-row 1 s stat poll to all in-flight [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows so marker transitions schedule exact artifact-delta r